# Simulator first

- Default board: `native_sim`.
- Second platform: `qemu_cortex_m3` when the lesson says twister on two platforms.
- Do not tell the student they must buy a DK to finish 00–12.
- S1/S2 may discuss hardware. They still must not block the core path.
